<speak version="1.0" xml:lang="en-US"
       xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis"
       xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts">
  <voice name="en-US-JennyNeural">
    <bookmark mark="overview"/>
    <p>This release adds an offline export to the <sub alias="software development kit">SDK</sub>. Your existing configuration still works.</p>
    <bookmark mark="instructions"/>
    <p>First, open settings.<break time="400ms"/>Then choose export. Keep the original file until you have checked the result.</p>
    <p>The verification code is <say-as interpret-as="characters">2048</say-as>. Enter it without spaces.</p>
    <bookmark mark="summary"/>
    <p><prosody rate="-10%">Check the exported file before you close the application.</prosody></p>
  </voice>
</speak>
